me generic ones, that drop from certain mobs and can be opened later to receive a bit of loot; this is an attempt to fix the inventory problem.&#10;- Made a new title that better fits the post-revamp state&#10;- Added the Extractor to complement the Collector, with a filter option and whitelist/blacklist option.&#10;- Added filter and whitelist/blacklist options for the Collector as well and made it so it can spit items directly onto conveyors rather than only into other machines - full automation is now possible!&#10;- Made a new panorama and title/icon for the new update!&#10;- Added darksteel (made using dark essence) and added it to Umbral goodie bag accordingly.&#10;- Added more metal cows and added gem chickens!&#10;- Various other minor fixes and changes.\">\r\n      <option name=\"closed\" value=\"true\" />\r\n      <created>1792239605962</created>\r\n      <option name=\"number\" value=\"00016\" />\r\n      <option name=\"presentableId\" value=\"LOCAL-00016\" />\r\n      <option name=\"project\" value=\"LOCAL\" />\r\n      <updated>1792239605962</updated>\r\n    </task>\r\n    <task id=\"LOCAL-00017\" summary=\"- Added the beginnings of many new dimensions, and finished Shroomia as a proof of concept.&#10;- Added new mushroom stuff: Purple, Green, and Yellow mushrooms, the Fungal Processor, a Block of Shroomium, and the Mushroom Catalyst.&#10;- Added the beginnings of Solaria, with Hydrogen and Helium Plasma blocks and Liquid Plasma fluid.&#10;- Added the Mana Inserter as an early-game alternative to an entire mana logistics system.&#10;- Added the Plasma Furnace, which smelts incredibly fast.&#10;- Added Plasmolium, a new ore found in Solaria&#10;- Added a recipe for a Fire Resistance ring to allow for going into Solaria.&#10;- Various other minor fixes and changes.\">\r\n      <option name=\"closed\" value=\"true\" />\r\n      <created>1793202169605</created>\r\n      <option name=\"number\" value=\"00017\" />\r\n      <option name=\"presentableId\" value=\"LOCAL-00017\" />\r\n      <option name=\"project\" value=\"LOCAL\" />\r\n      <updated>1793202169605</updated>\r\n    </task>\r\n    <option name=\"localTasksCounter\" value=\"18\" />\r\n    <servers />\r\n  </component>\r\n  <component name=\"TypeScriptGeneratedFilesManager\">\r\n    <option name=\"version\" value=\"3\" />\r\n  </component>\r\n  <component name=\"Vcs.Log.Tabs.Properties\">\r\n    <option name=\"TAB_STATES\">\r\n      <map>\r\n        <entry key=\"MAIN\">\r\n          <value>\r\n            <State />\r\n          </value>\r\n        </entry>\r\n      </map>\r\n    </option>\r\n  </component>\r\n  <component name=\"VcsManagerConfiguration\">\r\n    <option name=\"CHECK_CODE_SMELLS_BEFORE_PROJECT_COMMIT\" value=\"false\" />\r\n    <option name=\"CHECK_NEW_TODO\" value=\"false\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Finished implementing Hallowed one and made Void and Hallowed mobs attack each other.&#10;- Added some new Hallowed items.&#10;- Removed vanilla mobs &amp; structures from biome spawn lists.&#10;- Made Elves and Corrupted Elves attack each other.&#10;- Added the first five AltDim OST tracks: Fallen Hero, Lost Ruins, Outcast, Fading Away, and Final Struggle.&#10;- Converted more vanilla blocks/items to custom versions.&#10;- Added &amp; fixed custom crafting tables for different woods.&#10;- Added Romans, Vikings, their drops, and their reputation mechanic.&#10;- Added wooden tools for all wood types.&#10;- Added Phosphorium and Phosphorium Tools.&#10;- Rebalanced ore generation.&#10;- Added custom furnaces for each strata type.&#10;- Migrated glass and bowls over to custom ones.&#10;- Added new mobs and structures.&#10;- Tweaked recipes and loot tables to further migrate away from vanilla blocks and items.&#10;- Added more custom alternatives for vanilla stuff.&#10;- Added (buggy) aluminum buckets.&#10;- Added decorative platform blocks.&#10;- Added Beetle Queen and beetle variants, as well as the Scorched Tower.&#10;- Fixed many bugs\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Deleted Ice Cream Hills &amp; Candy Forest Biomes&#10;- Deleted Sugar Blocks and Chocolate Bar&#10;- Somewhat fixed the candy jetpack&#10;- Made some changes to worldgen&#10;- Fixed the Roman Spear&#10;- Added Shroomium Tools and made Shroomium Ore only breakable with mushy tools.&#10;- Added Graphite Rod.&#10;- Added Bow Utility procedures.&#10;- Added Planet Core.&#10;- Various minor changes and fixes.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Added Beetle Queen loot and upgraded Beetle Sword to a unique drop of her.&#10;- Added Mythril (ores, ingot, nugget, etc.) and a multi-step creation process for it.&#10;- Added Mythril and Phosphorium tools/armor.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Did a full refactor after merging from remote dev.&#10;- Fully fixed Instatunnel and added Instavator.&#10;- Added textures for pulling stages of Scorched Bow.&#10;- Made Umberflower generate naturally, and made a recipe to convert it to black dye.&#10;- Added Possessed Armor entity.&#10;- Added stone-tier tools for shale, veridium, and mantle.&#10;- Made various changes and fixes after the first playtest.&#10;- Added the Greenwood wood set.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Added the Spore Spreader mob and Shroomy Infection effect.&#10;- Made rings dynamic rather than hardcoded and made a dynamic data component/recipe manager for them.&#10;- Fixed the spawning of many mobs and the Ability goals.&#10;- Various other minor fixes and changes.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Refactored workspace to 2026.2 and Minecraft Neoforge 26.1.2.&#10;- Added many zombie variants.&#10;- Added the Blood Moon and support for other world events.&#10;- Other various minor fixes and changes.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Added many new materials and items, including Mana Stones, Mana Crystals, and tech components like Mana Coils and Circuits, importers, exporters, and drivetrain belts.&#10;- Completely deleted the old machine system and reimplemented a new, better, more user- and automation-friendly system based around &quot;mana.&quot;&#10;- Added two new structures to partly replace the deleted Pasta Mall.&#10;- Removed the Hexagem Complex and derivatives.&#10;- Made the recipes for the high-tier math weapons harder to get, requiring Aluminum and/or Mana Stones&#10;- Added physical blocks for Lemons and Limes, and made them and the Pear growth generate on Lush Forest trees and a new Fruit tree in the Fruity Gardens&#10;- Half-implemented the Blue Moon event - no special moon texture yet, but blue fog.&#10;- Buffed the portal wand recipe.&#10;- Added four new gems with their own gem blocks&#10;- Added the Iron Giant boss.&#10;- Added the Crude Salve and Crude Bandage&#10;- Added flesh drops for all the new zombie variants&#10;- Added two new flowers: the Cheeseflower and Magister's Bloom&#10;- Added Evilstone and Holystone tools, which give damage buffs to Hallowed and Void mobs, respectively.&#10;- Added three new spider variants: the Hydra, Venomous, and Incendiary spiders, each with their own special abilities.&#10;- Added the wooden club and a simple upgrade using venom glands, another new item.&#10;- Finally implemented a graphite rod recipe.&#10;- Added a Gem ore that drops a random gem, rather than the geodes (which were deleted)&#10;- Finally added a use for corn: Popcorn!&#10;- Many, many, many other minor fixes and changes.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Fixed a significant bug with gravestones and death.&#10;- Made some minor changes to creative tab icons.&#10;- Removed the choice for vanilla - AltDim mode is now the only mode.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Various minor changes and fixes.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Deleted the scorched bow because it was causing problems.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Added wall torch models and improved torch placement.&#10;- Reorganized some creative tabs.&#10;- Added the Cryonic Scimitar and Aluminum Storage Module.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Reorganized creative tabs.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Ported the entire spell system from SpellCaster API, including the wands, scrolls, and defaults spells, but not the datapack loading, commands, or extra firecharge functionality.&#10;- Finally fixed ring recipes!&#10;- Added the Viking Tower, Viking Ship, Hollow Candy Cane, Machine Ruins, and Mushroom Cottage structures, further improving the structure variety in the mod.&#10;- Fixed various other bugs and made other minor changes.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Added Math Essence and changed math material/weapon recipes accordingly&#10;- Removed the Hint Book and replaced it with a placeholder guidebook for later.&#10;- Added Aluminum, Titanium, Uranium, Evilstone, Mana Crystal, Quartz, and Mythril cows&#10;- Added the Axiomorph mob, a unique randomized mob.&#10;- Added the Willow (rare tree), Brimwood (creative-only), and Solar (rare tree) wood sets&#10;- Added Ore essence and duplication recipes for all ores using it.&#10;- Added the (mini?)boss HEROZOMBRINE&#10;- Added a couple of missing items, such as a Shroomy Box and Candyfloss tools.&#10;- Nerfed almost every mob in the game, especially Chefs and Waiters.&#10;- Removed the Electrified Spider's super-overpowered ability.&#10;- Finally fixed the aluminum storage module and added sound effects for opening/closing containers.&#10;- Added more slots to boxes (same as a normal chest now) and essence pouches (for the new essences).&#10;- Made mobs not drop any essences anymore, adding Goodie Bags as a replacement (see below)&#10;- Added Goodie Bags for each mob &quot;category&quot; (dark, light, ice, fire, life, candy, etc.), along with some generic ones, that drop from certain mobs and can be opened later to receive a bit of loot; this is an attempt to fix the inventory problem.&#10;- Made a new title that better fits the post-revamp state&#10;- Added the Extractor to complement the Collector, with a filter option and whitelist/blacklist option.&#10;- Added filter and whitelist/blacklist options for the Collector as well and made it so it can spit items directly onto conveyors rather than only into other machines - full automation is now possible!&#10;- Made a new panorama and title/icon for the new update!&#10;- Added darksteel (made using dark essence) and added it to Umbral goodie bag accordingly.&#10;- Added more metal cows and added gem chickens!&#10;- Various other minor fixes and changes.\" />\r\n    <MESSAGE value=\"- Added the beginnings of many new dimensions, and finished Shroomia as a proof of concept.&#10;- Added new mushroom stuff: Purple, Green, and Yellow mushrooms, the Fungal Processor, a Block of Shroomium, and the Mushroom Catalyst.&#10;- Added the beginnings of Solaria, with Hydrogen and Helium Plasma blocks and Liquid Plasma fluid.&#10;- Added the Mana Inserter as an early-game alternative to an entire mana logistics system.&#10;- Added the Plasma Furnace, which smelts incredibly fast.&#10;- Added Plasmolium, a new ore found in Solaria&#10;- Added a recipe for a Fire Resistance ring to allow for going into Solaria.&#10;- Various other minor fixes and changes.\" />\r\n    <option name=\"LAST_COMMIT_MESSAGE\" value=\"- Added the beginnings of many new dimensions, and finished Shroomia as a proof of concept.&#10;- Added new mushroom stuff: Purple, Green, and Yellow mushrooms, the Fungal Processor, a Block of Shroomium, and the Mushroom Catalyst.&#10;- Added the beginnings of Solaria, with Hydrogen and Helium Plasma blocks and Liquid Plasma fluid.&#10;- Added the Mana Inserter as an early-game alternative to an entire mana logistics system.&#10;- Added the Plasma Furnace, which smelts incredibly fast.&#10;- Added Plasmolium, a new ore found in Solaria&#10;- Added a recipe for a Fire Resistance ring to allow for going into Solaria.&#10;- Various other minor fixes and changes.\" />\r\n  </component>\r\n  <component name=\"XDebuggerManager\">\r\n    <breakpoint-manager>\r\n      <breakpoints>\r\n        <line-breakpoint enabled=\"true\" type=\"java-line\">\r\